This is a complete list of municipalities in [[Okaiken]] sorted by prefecture, reconstructed from the 2026 Okaiken Geography Database files. The list encompasses major metropolises, cities, towns, and villages across the country's 48 prefectural divisions. 

In Okaiken, municipal designations are generally applied based on population thresholds:
* '''Cities''' ({{lang|ja|市}}, ''shi''): Generally designated for populations exceeding 50,000.
* '''Towns''' ({{lang|ja|町}}, ''machi'' or ''chō''): Generally designated for populations between 10,000 and 50,000.
* '''Villages''' ({{lang|ja|村}}, ''mura'' or ''son''): Generally designated for populations under 10,000.

== Municipalities ==

This sortable table lists all municipalities in Okaiken as of the 2026 Okaiken Geography Database. Full raw data (including coordinates, exact area, and density) for every entry is available in the 48 prefecture CSVs (or direct download links).

